WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Guts!! gatsu gatsu!! Guts gatsu!! / 
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:34.180
Guts!! gatsu gatsu!! Guts gatsu!! / 
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:39.050
umai mon tachi yonderuze / 
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:43.590
kueba kuu hodo afureru Power!! / 
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.960
sekaijuu kara tsukamaero / 
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:51.500
yume ha muteki no gurume sa Fighter!! / 
I dream of being an invincible Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:56.500
saa! umi no soko e hyouga no hate e / 
Now on to the bottom of the sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:59.200
tonde Jump! Jump! Jump! tatake Knock! Knock! Knock! / 
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.440
kansha komete / 
Give thanks!

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:04.610
itadakimasu!! / 
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:10.450
Wow wo!! kugi punch Wow wo!! renpatsu de!! / 
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:15.520
gattsu gattsuri gattsu!! donna yume mo kueru /
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:20.790
Wow wo!! ore dake no Wow wo!! full course / 
Wow wo!! My very own... Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:24.960
gattsu gattsuri gattsu!! Atsumerunosa / 
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.030 --> 00:01:31.070
sekai wo sara ni nosete / 
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow yama wo kue!! / 
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow Toriko!! / 
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow umi wo kue!! / 
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:43.280
Wow wow wow tori tori tori Toriko!! / 
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:48.820
Someone once said:

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:51.090
There is a certain kind of citrus fruit

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:53.090
that's blue and glistens on the inside,

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:55.360
and if you squeeze it, sweet, refreshing,

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:58.760
first-rate Blue Hawaiian juice

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:01.300
with a faint citrus scent comes out...

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:05.870
The Blue Hawaiiangerine!

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:09.270
There are turtles with shells made of strawberry,

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:11.910
apple and blueberry tarts...

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:15.110
The Tartles!

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:18.680
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:23.520
An age in which people quest for yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:29.190
Toriko, Tommy and the others battled it out on Ice Mountain,

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:31.520
Takimaru, who was at death's door,

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:34.690
successfully completed the last-ditch preshot routine taught him by Aimaru,

00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:37.500
and unleashed the Corkscrew.

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:41.270
In order to have a more powerful swing,

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:44.240
the outmatched Match required three minutes of total relaxation.

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:47.710
Rum, Shin and Rui waged a desperate battle, buying Match the time he needed.

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:51.240
Match let loose the Dragon King Sword Split, defeating Barry.

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:54.350
Meanwhile, while heading to retrieve the soup,

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:56.920
Komatsu was intercepted by a masked man.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:59.190
However, the frantic Komatsu broke free of the man.

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:03.860
And the battle between Toriko and Tommy became even fiercer!

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:10.200
The Gourmet Reviver and the Legendary Soup's Location!

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:26.540
Flying Fork!

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.900
Spiked Punch!

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:02.510
Don't be overwhelmed just yet!

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:05.120
I've got a lot more bugs where they came from!

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.190
What...?

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:11.620
Go!

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:15.530
Flying Fork!

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:29.010
What are those two?!

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:37.350
They're so far out of my league, I can't do a damn thing!

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:10.880
Toriko!

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.380
I have a bad feeling about these suckers!

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.990
Switch on!

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.000
What was that?!

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.140
I'm counting on you!

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:45.150
This is the first time Toriko-san's depended on me!

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:55.720
I made it!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.650
Where's the soup?

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:34.190
That's the lowest part of the Gourmet Show Window...

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:36.460
...so why...?

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:40.770
Why can't I see the aurora at all?

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:43.940
Wait... Century Soup is really transparent...

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:45.400
I just can't see it...

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:50.680
I don't believe it...

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:56.680
It can't be...

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:02.250
No... It can't turn out like this...

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:07.320
Everyone shed blood, sweat and tears to get here...

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:13.530
There isn't any soup...?!

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:19.470
Shhh...

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:27.610
What lousy handwriting! I can't read that!

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:30.510
That's even worse!

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.180
No way...

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:36.020
I'm bugged?

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.730
What is this? The cold shoulder?

00:07:50.730 --> 00:07:52.840
Loose lips sink ships.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:55.000
I see...

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:05.380
Um... The bugging device was planted by our client, Monroe Yakkoi?

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:06.920
His handwriting is still barely legible

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:08.750
and he got the name of the client wrong!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.590
It's Colonel Mokkoi!

00:08:10.650 --> 00:08:13.020
But... But this...

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.390
Is it true?

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:21.330
He's clammed up again!

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:23.130
I confirmed it myself. It's no mistake.

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:24.170
You talked!

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.600
This is terrible...

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:29.370
Even I can't do anything for them now...

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.970
Are you one of them?

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:34.180
You're wasting your time.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:36.610
I'm not even here.

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:40.310
You should go back and get the soup.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.580
I don't care who finds it.

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:45.190
I'll gladly pay every yen I promised.

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:49.790
Oh, say...

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:52.890
You don't mind if I remove this bugging device, do you?

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.360
You noticed it?!

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:56.560
Yeah.

00:08:56.600 --> 00:08:58.200
What are you?!

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:01.000
It hurts 'cause it keeps rubbing against my bone.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.440
That listening device is part and parcel of the suit.

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:04.970
It can't be taken off.

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:09.380
Although if you can survive this tundra without the suit, be my guest.

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:11.710
In that case, I'll change clothes.

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:12.380
What?!

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:14.580
I brought my own along, anyway.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:15.720
Although it's a hand-me-down from my master,

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:16.520
so I'm not really fired up about wearing it.

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:17.920
But what are you gonna do, you know?

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:21.290
Or to be blunt, I'll be fine without your Lighter Suit.

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:23.220
True, I don't care for the cold, but...

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:24.590
Am I talking too much?

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:36.470
If he finds out there is no soup, he'll probably go home and leave us here.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.010
It's true...

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:43.040
The soup really is...

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.550
What the hell is this?!

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:49.350
Tina-san! And, um, you...

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:50.480
It's Zonge!

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.950
Komatsu-kun... Don't tell me this is...

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:53.550
I don't believe it!

00:09:53.590 --> 00:09:54.490
Tina-san, no!

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:55.650
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.890
Hey! Are you serious?!

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.960
We came all the way here...?!

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:01.530
There isn't any...

00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:10.800
You talk too much.

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:15.410
Be silent. I just Knocked him.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:16.410
Relax.

00:10:16.440 --> 00:10:17.410
Phew!

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:21.610
Yeesh... One more word out of him and the cat would've been out of the bag.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:24.820
There's no soup here.

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:26.780
There's no soup here...

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:29.090
There's no soup here...

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:45.840
Hey! Remember what you just said?!

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:47.470
Loose lips sail ships?!

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:49.510
Shhh... Converse via notes.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.070
It's too late for that!

00:10:51.110 --> 00:10:52.840
And you just said that out loud, too!

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:57.580
Zonge-sama!

00:10:57.610 --> 00:10:58.710
W-What's wrong, Komatsu-kun?

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:00.220
What the heck is going on?!

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:03.120
I've had that information for a while now.

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:07.660
Just as I feared, there is no soup...

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:10.860
Hey, raise the anchor. We're going home.

00:11:10.930 --> 00:11:14.430
Yes, sir. What about the Gourmet Hunters that are still on the island?

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:16.770
I'm done with them. Leave them behind.

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:19.330
I'm going to shut down the robot now.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:21.700
I'm reluctant to leave the Century Soup behind,

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:23.970
but there are still plenty of fascinating ingredients left,

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:28.740
like the Lion Pig, the Lapis Turtle's Tears and Infinite Grapes.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:38.050
Well, now... Which ingredient shall I go after next?

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:52.370
Switch on!

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:07.780
T-Toriko?! Where are you?!

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:08.880
Toriko!

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:26.500
You stripped an instant before the explosion, did you?!

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:31.100
But can you fight without insulated clothing?!

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:32.670
Don't worry.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.010
It won't take me much time at all to beat you to a pulp.

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.040
Don't be reckless.

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:44.220
You can't fight in this sub-zero temperature without a Lighter Suit.

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:47.050
U-Use mine.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:48.320
Match!

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:50.790
Match!

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:56.930
I wanna fight alongside you, but I'm afraid I'd just drag you down here.

00:12:56.930 --> 00:13:01.230
It's pathetic... that this is about all I can do.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:02.800
Forgive me.

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:04.040
You...

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:09.710
Takimaru...

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:11.580
I see...

00:13:11.610 --> 00:13:13.510
Their battles are over.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.850
Toriko! Behind you!

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:19.450
Hey! The bugs are coming!

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:20.690
Watch out!

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:22.820
Match...

00:13:25.260 --> 00:13:27.090
You fought well.

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:28.990
Thank you.

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:31.060
Toriko...

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:33.700
You use the Lighter Suit.

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:35.270
I don't need it.

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:38.470
What is this sensation?

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:40.570
It feels like...

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:44.010
It feels like I'm surrounded by a huge forest or something...

00:13:51.820 --> 00:13:54.720
The bugs aren't attacking?

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:07.500
How could you two have lost?!

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:10.030
I don't need you anymore!

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:12.900
The least you can do is feed my pets!

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:22.710
Lay your eggs in that garbage, insects!

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:24.010
Hey! Stop!

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:25.880
They're not dead yet!

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.120
Don't do it!

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:29.220
They're your comrades, aren't they?!

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:54.080
W-What was that?

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:57.150
For just a moment, the air shook!

00:14:57.810 --> 00:14:58.910
It's hot...

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:01.550
Is that heat coming off of Toriko?

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:04.190
What the hell is going on?!

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:14.430
So he sent me to get Toriko and the Century Soup...

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:17.870
Oh? I've heard that already.

00:15:18.070 --> 00:15:21.570
Yes. But there's something that bothers me about it...

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:25.370
What is it? You're beating around the bush.

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:28.710
Sorry. I'll ask you directly.

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:32.950
The Century Soup doesn't exist anymore, does it?

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:36.350
You're really good at fortune-telling.

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:38.850
Yes. On top of that,

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:42.460
I have information that the Gourmet Corp. is also searching for the soup.

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:45.490
And they've apparently dispatched some of their master hands.

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:48.790
With all the fortunes I've done,

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:50.900
I've never felt such danger approaching as this.

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:54.600
In that case, you really should go.

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:56.770
The ingredients choose the person.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:16:00.970
Even if you can't get what you came for, it can't be helped.

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:02.710
I know that, but...

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:06.210
Those boys were prepared to face anything when they went.

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:08.850
They didn't know about the Gourmet Corp.,

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:11.820
but it isn't anything to be alarmed about.

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:12.920
Granny Setsu...

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:16.220
Actually, I've already taken measures.

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:18.220
Though I don't know how it'll turn out...

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:22.530
The key is Komatsu-kun. Yes...

00:16:26.060 --> 00:16:27.500
Say what?!

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:30.270
Then we can't leave this continent either?!

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:33.440
Well, so it seems...

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:38.280
Uh, I think you can talk now...

00:16:39.680 --> 00:16:42.650
Zonge-sama! It's gonna be the bad ending we've feared!

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:45.650
I should've taken over the family tofu shop!

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:48.290
The critical soup is gone...

00:16:48.350 --> 00:16:49.420
Talk about kicking someone when she's down...

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:50.990
Are you okay?

00:16:51.020 --> 00:16:53.660
I never thought you'd come here too, Tina-san...

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:57.260
As if I wouldn't chase a huge scoop like this?!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:00.930
The Colonel hates the media, so I disguised myself to get on board.

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:04.470
Although the idea was to stick with Toriko...

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:07.370
This has been the biggest failure of my career as a newscaster!

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:10.210
Zonge-sama! Even though it's gonna end like this,

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.880
I'm happy that I'm with you!

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:14.080
In fact, hey, you!

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:17.680
Would you break this paralyzing spell already?!

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:19.920
It's not a spell. It's Knocking!

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:22.080
How far are you gonna take this RPG stuff?!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:25.090
I said you might as well talk!

00:17:25.090 --> 00:17:26.120
It won't wear off for a while yet.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:28.490
Seems to me he's really put his heart into it.

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:38.100
Um...

00:17:39.670 --> 00:17:44.410
I thought only Toriko could do Knocking with his fingers.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.810
Just who are you?!

00:17:57.190 --> 00:17:58.620
My... name... is...

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:01.190
If you say it, you don't have to write it.

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:02.360
Oh, sorry.

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:04.030
My name is Teppei.

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:06.630
I'm a Gourmet Reviver.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.100
Gour...

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.870
Gourmet Reviver?!

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.040
Yeah. That's right.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:15.270
Good to meet you.

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:32.290
Appreciate your fighting partners a little for their pains.

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:34.860
It's hot...

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:38.160
Toriko's body... is putting out an incredible amount of heat...

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:40.390
What's this about?

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.960
You say such childish things.

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:46.000
Guys who are incapable of doing their job are trash!

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:47.570
So I'm going to kill them!

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:51.540
Toriko, you too...

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:54.110
Hurry up and die!

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.580
Tommyrod...

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:00.710
You're a low-down scoundrel!

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:03.420
I'm definitely gonna exterminate you!

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.630
Toriko!

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:22.830
W-What is this?!

00:19:54.930 --> 00:19:55.830
All right!

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:57.640
Wha...?! His frozen right hand is...

00:19:57.740 --> 00:19:58.740
I see...

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:01.270
Thawing out through shivering, eh?

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:02.710
Shivering?

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:06.940
Certainly, there's a physiological phenomenon,

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:10.280
called shivering that will raise your temperature...

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:13.020
Shivering... I see!

00:20:17.220 --> 00:20:19.990
When Toriko shivered, it created vibrations so strong

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:22.130
that they made the air shake.

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:25.900
He also released an incredible amount of heat.

00:20:25.960 --> 00:20:30.100
So even in this sub-zero temperature, he doesn't need a Lighter Suit.

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:34.600
And shivering made him focus on his right hand...

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:38.410
Amazing... What is he, a human heater?

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:44.280
Still... doing all this must have burned a lot of calories!

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:46.220
A childish trick!

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:49.550
Quit relying on the bugs and come at me yourself!

00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:52.660
No thanks.

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:54.890
Idiot!

00:21:02.860 --> 00:21:05.200
I'm finally able to get near you...

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:07.000
...Tommyrod!

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:14.040
Eat this 10-fold Spiked Punch!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:26.590
GURI-GURI☆HUNGRY ja MURI-MURI☆ onaka ga suita / 
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:30.860
kyo mo dokoka de SOS kyah pinch da YES!!! / 
Today we're out there: Ack SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:34.260
ikanakucha! ikanakucha! hottoke nai ne / 
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't leave this alone, right?

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:37.730
kimi no ouendan ninmu wa mou mugendai  / 
Giving you support and cheer, the duties are endless!

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:41.100
moe chatte! ton jatte! trouble buster / 
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:41.140 --> 00:21:44.140
oh mai gah ohmori genki / 
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:47.940
hara ga hette wa power ga denai! / 
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:47.980 --> 00:21:51.480
GO!! FIGHT!! kimi ni attention / 
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:54.610
souhoukou communication / 
Two-way communication!

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:58.150
uketotta seien wa eiyou desu! / 
The encouragement I get from you is my nourishment!

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:01.890
ippai delicious shitaina / 
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:22:01.890 --> 00:22:05.260
mirai wa gochisou da / 
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:07.130
migi OK hidari OK / 
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:11.800
kiotsuke yuukan ni! iza! susumi masho / 
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:22:11.860 --> 00:22:15.400
kentou wo! / 
Fight with bravery!

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:19.110
DELI-DELI☆DELICIOUS de itadaki ma-su☆ / 
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:25.510
Gourmet News!

00:22:27.350 --> 00:22:29.210
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:33.520
Toriko's shivering produced heat like a heater.

00:22:33.520 --> 00:22:34.990
Apparently, with that heat,

00:22:35.020 --> 00:22:38.460
it would've been possible to bake a million dango in an instant!

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:43.830
So today I'll teach you a simple way to enjoy the flavor of mitarashi dango.

00:22:43.900 --> 00:22:46.130
If you pour some soy sauce on top of vanilla ice cream,

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:49.170
it should taste just like mitarashi dango!

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:54.240
It really does taste like mitarashi dango!

00:22:54.270 --> 00:22:55.840
This is a heaping helping of illusion!

00:22:55.910 --> 00:22:57.810
Hot dang it's cold dango!

00:22:58.440 --> 00:22:59.440
I'm cold...

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.450
Shivering!

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:04.820
Now, on to the next story.

00:23:07.230 --> 00:23:08.510
Blurgh!

00:23:08.510 --> 00:23:11.640
A massive swarm of bugs attacks Toriko! Bugs!? Bugs!

00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:13.310
This battle just got too crazy for me!

00:23:13.790 --> 00:23:17.030
Head-on Fight! Fierce Battle! 
Toriko vs. Tommyrod!

00:23:17.380 --> 00:23:19.290
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
